[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mlocalStorage (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mSurvives browser restart, shared across tabs, client-only. Matches "persists" and "works across the app" with the [39m
     [38;5;246mcurrent stub backend.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Cookie
     [38;5;246mExplicit expiry and automatically sent to the server on requests. Useful if the backend will need to read the id, [39m
     [38;5;246mbut adds SameSite/Secure handling.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m sessionStorage
     [38;5;246mCleared when the tab closes and not shared between tabs. Lightest on privacy, but does not really satisfy "it [39m
